          "value": "secp256k1 is this library's only curve — the heart of every key, signature and address. Three provider paths: pure-Ruby OpenSSL (OpenSSL::PKey::EC.new('secp256k1')), direct FFI to OpenSSL libcrypto (NID_secp256k1=714, EC_KEY_* chain in ffi/openssl.rb), and FFI to libsecp256k1 (ffi/secp256k1.rb — full API: context create/randomize/destroy, seckey_verify, pubkey create/parse/serialize, ecdsa_sign, ecdsa_verify, recoverable sign/recover, signature normalize/serialize/parse, plus flag constants and "
